  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "合作與非營利志願服務",
    "sub_ename": "EXPERIENTIAL STUDY IN COOPERATIVES, NONPROFITS, AND VOLUNTEERING MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "源自於服務學習的理念架構和經驗技術的考量和最佳實作特色的考量，本課程以厚實學生敬業態度與從業倫理理想，積極落實實務運作、經驗與倫理，增進產官學合作介面與互動，回饋改善教學模式與過程品質和職能內容，以增進多元生涯能力與興趣和增進職場競爭力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course us characterized by best practice and service learning paradigm. It is aimed to the quality assurance for students' marketability and competitiveness. For promoting the professional knowledge, skill/experience, attitudes and such behavioral characteristics as corporate social responsibilities and so on. Coordinated teaching groups composed of teaching and practice from different fields for empowering students' competencies. The apprentice-like tutorial system is also formulated as for improving those competencies preferred in occupational contexts.",
